# Implementation Plan - Standardize Navigation Bar

This plan aims to ensure that the "Uncertainty" link is consistently present in the navigation bar across all relevant HTML files. Research has identified that [compliance.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/compliance.html) is currently missing this link.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name] UI - Sidebar Navigation

#### [MODIFY] [compliance.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/compliance.html)

Add the following HTML snippet to the `<ul class="nav-links">` section, after the "Compliance" link:

```html
<li class="nav-item">
    <a href="uncertainty.html" class="nav-link">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
